What is the SHA256 hash of this file?
Answer: 56554117d96d12bd3504ebef2a8f28e790dd1fe583c33ad58ccbf614313ead8c

The next step tells us to go to Microsoft Defender XDR and search the hash using the intel explorer tool. Unfortunately, you need a corporate account to login, but luckily they give us screenshots to work with.
What is the score assigned to this file?
