Section 2: It's Giving Sleet
Under the Articles section of the Defender XDR report for this file, there is one article listed. What is the title of that article?
Answer: Moonstone Sleet using malicious tank game to infect devices

Scroll down to the Intel Profiles section and click on the Moonstone Sleet Actor Profile. Which country is Moonstone Sleet based out of?
Answer: North Korea

Moonstone Sleet targets individuals and organizations within the software development, information technology, education, and __ _ sectors.
Answer: defense industrial base

Moonstone Sleet's attacks are focused on the goals of __ and revenue generation.
Answer: espionage

Moonstone Sleet has demonstrated a significant overlap with which other North Korean threat actor?
Answer: Diamond Sleet

Go back to the file overview and click on the Moonstone Sleet using malicious tank game to infect devices article. According to the article, when did this campaign begin?
Answer: February 2024

According to the article, the initial access vectors used in this campaign include messaging platforms and .
Answer: email

The report includes a screenshot of a sample phishing email. What is the domain name included in that email?
Answer: detankwar.com

Check our email logs to see if we can find any evidence of detankwar.com.
Email
| where link has "detankwar.com"
How many emails were seen in the logs?
Answer: 6

How many distinct TitanShield employees were targeted?
Email
| where link has "DeTankWar"
| distinct recipient
